95
00:03:33,052 --> 00:03:35,492
If Sean quits running after seeing this, it'd be crazy.

96
00:03:35,752 --> 00:03:36,951
- It'd be crazy. - If Sean quits,

97
00:03:36,952 --> 00:03:39,662
- it proves how influential I am. - Right.

98
00:03:41,262 --> 00:03:44,032
I've been very tired lately because of my demanding workload.

99
00:03:44,492 --> 00:03:48,061
A lot of my friends told me that running is the best way...

100
00:03:48,062 --> 00:03:50,132
- It sure is. - to boost my energy.

101
00:03:50,732 --> 00:03:54,542
When I went to Na Rae's grandmother's place.

102
00:03:54,742 --> 00:03:56,412
I was quite amazed by Kian84.

103
00:03:56,542 --> 00:03:59,241
- Seriously. He was amazing. - He had great stamina.

104
00:03:59,242 --> 00:04:00,442
He had great stamina.

105
