Running might have damaged his looks.

106
00:04:03,712 --> 00:04:05,182
But his stamina has improved.

107
00:04:05,352 --> 00:04:07,581
I'd say Kian84's running style is demanding on the body.

108
00:04:07,582 --> 00:04:09,491
But my running is all about wellness.

109
00:04:09,492 --> 00:04:11,792
- Wellness? - I'm cherishing my body.

110
00:04:12,222 --> 00:04:13,591
It's called I-Love-Myself Running.

111
00:04:13,592 --> 00:04:15,592
- What's running for wellness? - I love myself.

112
00:04:16,092 --> 00:04:18,161
"Run as you love yourself."

113
00:04:18,162 --> 00:04:20,532
It's about wellness. If it's too hard, take a break.

114
00:04:20,732 --> 00:04:22,302
Don't be stressed. Don't curse.

115
00:04:22,902 --> 00:04:24,932
If it's too hard, just stop.

116
00:04:25,672 --> 00:04:26,802
That's a good motto.

117
00:04:27,942 --> 00:04:30,642
Just stop. Sit down. Lie down.

118
00:04:31,072 --> 00:04:33,481
Because we only see hardcore runners like Kian84,

119
00:04:33,482 --> 00:04:35,852
