But that's not true, KEY.

124
00:04:42,892 --> 00:04:44,021
Even KEY can do it.

125
00:04:44,022 --> 00:04:45,362
If I can do this, he can too.

126
00:04:45,922 --> 00:04:48,522
It helps me improve my endurance without burdening my body.

127
00:04:48,962 --> 00:04:50,122
I call it the Moomoo Running.

128
00:04:50,532 --> 00:04:53,202
I'll lead a new kind of running trend.

129
00:04:53,702 --> 00:04:55,531
