183
00:06:53,652 --> 00:06:55,491
They were launched for the first time last year.

184
00:06:55,492 --> 00:06:57,922
The colors have been changing.

185
00:06:58,122 --> 00:06:59,392
Newer editions keep coming out.

186
00:06:59,562 --> 00:07:02,392
The most important thing to look for when picking out shoes is...

187
00:07:02,732 --> 00:07:03,931
how they feel on your feet.

188
00:07:03,932 --> 00:07:06,262
- It's how they feel on your feet. - What is he doing?

189
00:07:06,432 --> 00:07:08,201
- Okay. - The upper...

190
