You have especially big and wide feet.

191
00:07:10,402 --> 00:07:12,002
- He's so distracting. - So...

192
00:07:12,142 --> 00:07:14,571
- make sure they aren't too narrow. - They aren't.

193
00:07:14,572 --> 00:07:17,072
