194
00:07:17,312 --> 00:07:19,441
So these shoes are trendy now, right?

195
00:07:19,442 --> 00:07:20,942
(Reconfirming)

196
00:07:21,312 --> 00:07:23,811
I like how they feel on my feet and the level of bounciness.

197
00:07:23,812 --> 00:07:24,882
They're good shoes.

198
00:07:25,452 --> 00:07:26,521
What do you think?

199
00:07:26,522 --> 00:07:28,021
- I'll get these. - Those?

200
00:07:28,022 --> 00:07:29,742
- I'll ring them up for you. - Yes, please.

201
00:07:30,822 --> 00:07:34,461
I want a breathable outfit.

202
00:07:34,462 --> 00:07:37,332
Is there an outfit that wipes sweat naturally?

203
00:07:37,562 --> 00:07:39,132
An outfit that wipes sweat naturally?

204
00:07:39,332 --> 00:07:41,932
I wore an outfit from this brand when I recently ran 100km.

205
00:07:42,272 --> 00:07:44,472
(Listening intently)

206
00:07:44,772 --> 00:07:45,842
Does it absorb sweat well?

207
00:07:46,872 --> 00:07:47,972
Does it absorb sweat well?

208
00:07:48,772 --> 00:07:50,272
Would you say it's the best?

209
00:07:50,372 --> 00:07:53,581
- Personally, I'd say it's the best. - Really?

210
00:07:53,582 --> 00:07:55,382
I wore this top with these shorts.

211
00:07:55,912 --> 00:07:57,412
This was my outfit.

212
00:07:57,512 --> 00:07:58,872
