My mom is good at that.

217
00:08:08,762 --> 00:08:11,191
- He's the icon of unfilial sons. - I'm serious. She likes doing that.

218
00:08:11,192 --> 00:08:12,231
Seriously.

219
00:08:12,232 --> 00:08:15,471
- She really likes doing that. - Come on. Don't do that.

220
00:08:15,472 --> 00:08:16,731
She takes out the laundry in the washer...

221
00:08:16,732 --> 00:08:17,972
