222
00:08:18,432 --> 00:08:19,871
- She takes them out on purpose. - You know what I think?

223
00:08:19,872 --> 00:08:21,472
You need to serve in the military again.

224
00:08:21,902 --> 00:08:22,971
He should.

225
00:08:22,972 --> 00:08:24,941
- He must join the Marines camp. - You need to cry about your mom.

226
00:08:24,942 --> 00:08:27,142
